        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Sign in to Dreamina in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → Dreamina → Dreamina Settings**.\n2. Describe the poster in **Brief**. Put any words it must show in quotation marks.\n3. Press **Run**. The poster and its upscaled version are saved under `image/dreamina`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
